{"id":"e8b2d4f1-7a39-4c05-9d6e-1f4b8a3c5e27","revision":0,"last_node_id":11,"last_link_id":13,"nodes":[{"id":11,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[40,351],"size":[620,600],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"使用说明","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"MarkdownNote","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["## 环境音效 (HunyuanVideo-Foley)\n\n**引擎**: HunyuanVideo-Foley (腾讯混元)\n**权重**: `models/foley/hunyuanvideo_foley.safetensors`（本地现成）\n**配套**: `vae_128d_48k_fp16.safetensors` + `synchformer_state_dict_fp16.safetensors`\n\n### md 表字段 → 节点接线\n- **音效提示词** → `Hunyuan-Foley Sampler` 的 `prompt`\n- **秒数** → 同节点的 `duration`（**上限 60 秒**）\n- **ID** → `SaveAudioAdvanced` 的 `filename_prefix`\n\n### 链路\nMD 数据表 → Foley 采样器（模型 + 依赖）→ 预览 → 继续闸门 → 保存\n\n### 关键说明\n- **纯文本模式**：本工作流不接图像，Foley 走 `Text-to-Audio` 分支（视觉特征置零），\n  适合「雨声 / 车流 / 人群」这类与画面无关的环境铺底\n- **若有参考画面**：把视频帧接到 `Hunyuan-Foley Sampler` 的 `image` 输入，即切到 Video-to-Audio 模式，\n  音效会与画面对齐（脚步落在节拍上）\n- **步数 50 / cfg 4.5**：官方默认配方\n- **force_offload=true**：显存不足时自动卸载，8G 卡建议保持开启\n- **去 LLM 改写**：本工作流直连 md 表提示词，不做二次改写\n\n### 与 0062 的区别\n- 0061 走 Foley：擅长**长时、连续、有层次**的环境声（60 秒内）\n- 0062 走 Stable Audio 3 small_sfx：擅长**短促、单次**的效果声（1–5 秒）"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## 环境音效 (HunyuanVideo-Foley)\n\n**引擎**: HunyuanVideo-Foley (腾讯混元)\n**权重**: `models/foley/hunyuanvideo_foley.safetensors`（本地现成）\n**配套**: `vae_128d_48k_fp16.safetensors` + `synchformer_state_dict_fp16.safetensors`\n\n### md 表字段 → 节点接线\n- **音效提示词** → `Hunyuan-Foley Sampler` 的 `prompt`\n- **秒数** → 同节点的 `duration`（**上限 60 秒**）\n- **ID** → `SaveAudioAdvanced` 的 `filename_prefix`\n\n### 链路\nMD 数据表 → Foley 采样器（模型 + 依赖）→ 预览 → 继续闸门 → 保存\n\n### 关键说明\n- **纯文本模式**：本工作流不接图像，Foley 走 `Text-to-Audio` 分支（视觉特征置零），\n  适合「雨声 / 车流 / 人群」这类与画面无关的环境铺底\n- **若有参考画面**：把视频帧接到 `Hunyuan-Foley Sampler` 的 `image` 输入，即切到 Video-to-Audio 模式，\n  音效会与画面对齐（脚步落在节拍上）\n- **步数 50 / cfg 4.5**：官方默认配方\n- **force_offload=true**：显存不足时自动卸载，8G 卡建议保持开启\n- **去 LLM 改写**：本工作流直连 md 表提示词，不做二次改写\n\n### 与 0062 的区别\n- 0061 走 Foley：擅长**长时、连续、有层次**的环境声（60 秒内）\n- 0062 走 Stable Audio 3 small_sfx：擅长**短促、单次**的效果声（1–5 秒）"},"color":"#222","bgcolor":"#000"},{"id":1,"type":"FallingTSMarkDownTable","pos":[740,351],"size":[480,570],"flags":{},"order":1,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"data","name":"data","type":"FALLINGTS_MD_TABLE","widget":{"name":"data"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"name":"ID","type":"STRING","slot_index":0,"links":[5]},{"name":"音效提示词","type":"STRING","slot_index":1,"links":[1]},{"name":"秒数","type":"INT","slot_index":2,"links":[2]},{"name":"整行数据","type":"STRING","links":[]}],"title":"MD 数据表 (环境音效)","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"FallingTSMarkDownTable","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{"data":true},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":[{"md_path":"stories/七纹刻印/0061_环境音效.md","fields":[{"name":"ID","type":"STRING"},{"name":"音效提示词","type":"TEXT"},{"name":"秒数","type":"INT"}],"selected":{"id":"00001_窗外夜雨","values":{"ID":"00001_窗外夜雨","音效提示词":"连续三天的深夜细雨敲打窗户，雨点细密地落在玻璃上，玻璃表面蒙着水雾和雨痕，远处传来城市车流的低沉声与高楼之间的闷响，安静而持续的雨夜氛围。","秒数":"30"}}}],"widgets_values_named":{"data":{"md_path":"stories/七纹刻印/0061_环境音效.md","fields":[{"name":"ID","type":"STRING"},{"name":"音效提示词","type":"TEXT"},{"name":"秒数","type":"INT"}],"selected":{"id":"00001_窗外夜雨","values":{"ID":"00001_窗外夜雨","音效提示词":"连续三天的深夜细雨敲打窗户，雨点细密地落在玻璃上，玻璃表面蒙着水雾和雨痕，远处传来城市车流的低沉声与高楼之间的闷响，安静而持续的雨夜氛围。","秒数":"30"}}}}},{"id":2,"type":"HunyuanModelLoader","pos":[1300,351],"size":[360,178],"flags":{},"order":2,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"HUNYUAN_MODEL","name":"HUNYUAN_MODEL","type":"HUNYUAN_MODEL","slot_index":0,"links":[6]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"HunyuanModelLoader","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{"model_name":true,"precision":true,"quantization":true},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["hunyuanvideo_foley.safetensors","bf16","auto"],"widgets_values_named":{"model_name":"hunyu